  "cover_text": "Here you will find solutions for all your mobile power phone lease and rental questions.\\n<What is a cd?\\nA CD stands for Compact Disc – A compact disc is a disc used to store a recorded audio or video signal. A computer, radio, television, camcorder, DVD player or similar device watch or play from the CD’s data disk. A CD is usually 3.54 mm thick (or greater) and wound in a polyvinyl chloride (PVC) drum. The wider the diameter of the groove across the face of your cd, the louder the music.",
